@ [canonical_uuid] e85eaf67-561e-4811-8466-3ade1a788a59

& [Need]
  + the published capability receipt proves a local command partition but intentionally omits current upstream admission write-prevention complete post-state process consequence and B1 eligibility
  + B2 cannot be responsibly formed from capability evidence alone

& [Choice]
  + join the existing authoritative pure forms and perform one provider-free current-host preflight on fresh C-drive scratch
  + require both prevention canaries and full detection inventory so policy failure becomes evidence rather than product damage
  + retain the exact B1 stage and avoid changing B0 SWA-04A Phase3A or the historical NotRun result

& [WhyNow]
  + the selected executable identity and read/deny capability are pinned and independently verified
  + the seam makes the next required product truth more complete without depending on the unavailable provider

& [Nonchoice]
  + do not substitute another host provider durable custody remote machine D-drive FPGA Minecraft or a weakened read-only schema
  + do not treat App Server schema text remote equality or a successful allowed read as a complete preflight

& [Value]
  + success produces the first exact B1 eligibility receipt and enables evidence-based B2 formation
  + refusal produces actionable host admission profile process or consequence evidence while leaving product and foreign work unchanged
